Package: @@APP_ID@@
Version: @@VERSION@@
Architecture: @@ARCH@@
Maintainer: @@MAINTAINER@@
Installed-Size: @@SIZE@@
Depends: systemd, bash
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: @@HOMEPAGE@@
Description: Xunlei (迅雷) download station for TOS 7
 Xunlei remote download service for TerraMaster TOS 7, packaged from
 the official Xunlei NAS engine (upstream platform build "linux") and
 configured for platform "terramaster", so Xunlei's cloud serves this
 device the TerraMaster profile.
 .
 The web UI opens inside the TOS desktop as an embedded iframe at
 /@@APP_ID@@/. The engine serves its single page app on port
 @@WEBUI_PORT@@ and the TOS nginx reverse proxies it under
 /@@APP_ID@@/app/ , so nothing has to be forwarded on the router to use
 the app locally.
 .
 Downloads live in the shared folder "@@SHARE_NAME@@" and stay reachable
 over SMB/NFS. Login state and engine configuration live in
 /var/lib/@@APP_ID@@ . Both survive upgrade and uninstall.
 .
 Engine: Xunlei (c) Xunlei Limited, distributed by Xunlei from its own
 public CDN. This package only re-packages that official artifact for
 TOS 7; it patches nothing inside the engine. See
 /usr/local/@@APP_ID@@/PROVENANCE.md for the audit chain.
 Upstream: https://www.xunlei.com    Packaged for TOS by @@PUBLISHER@@